  "plan": "1. Check disk free space with df -h. 2. Clean apt lists and any large temp files. 3. Retry the install. If /var is still too small, I can set apt's cache to another location or clean more aggressively.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "df -h / /var /tmp 2>&1\n",
